      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "-: So we set everything up in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.39,
          "en": "Now let's create our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.39,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "Now we could initialize it right here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 9.96,
          "en": "to set up value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.96,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "immediately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 12.173,
          "en": "but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.173,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "I don't like to do this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "I want to have it in a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 17.97,
          "en": "because it actually is quite a lot of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 17.97,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "and it's not the best place to have it right here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "at the top in the property declaration area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "So I will use the OnInit lifecycle for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 27.81,
          "en": "So I will import OnInit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 27.81,
          "end": 30.9,
          "en": "make sure to import it from at angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "And therefore I'm required to implement the NGOnInit method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "And in here I will initialize my form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "You should initialize it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 41.79,
          "en": "before rendering the template, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.79,
          "end": 43.89,
          "en": "So make sure to use a lifecycle hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.89,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "which is called before the template is rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "Here, I will set up my sign up form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "and we'll set it equal to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 52.23,
          "en": "to what?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.23,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "Well keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "sign up form is of type form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "So we need to create a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "form group here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 63.45,
          "en": "Now we have almost a valid form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 63.45,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "We need to pass a JavaScript object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 67.74,
          "en": "and we're theoretically done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "This is our first created form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 73.08,
          "en": "This JavaScript object configures it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 73.08,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "and as it's empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "it simply says, or it tells angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 79.35,
          "en": "Hey, this form doesn't have any controls,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 81.06,
          "en": "so let's add some.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 84.93,
          "en": "Controls are basically just key value pairs in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 84.93,
          "end": 87.81,
          "en": "we pass to the overall form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 87.81,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "So let's have a look at our HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "We have a username field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 93.36,
          "en": "and a email field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 93.36,
          "end": 96.3,
          "en": "and then we got the radio buttons here at the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "So it would make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 99.78,
          "en": "a username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 100.92,
          "en": "control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 100.92,
          "end": 103.92,
          "en": "I'm wrapping this in quotation marks to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 103.92,
          "end": 104.753,
          "en": "that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 104.753,
          "end": 105.586,
          "en": "during",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 105.586,
          "end": 106.419,
          "en": "minification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 106.419,
          "end": 108.36,
          "en": "when this code gets mangled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 110.00999999999999,
          "en": "this property name is kept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 110.00999999999999,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "because I will reference it in the HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 115.53,
          "en": "This might not be necessary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "it might not get destroyed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "but just to be sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "I'm wrapping it as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 122.543,
          "en": "So here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 122.543,
          "end": 124.14,
          "en": "what is this now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "Well this is a form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
